.\" Begin generated content:
.TH "swappy" "1" "2025-08-27"
.PP
.SH "نام (NAME)"
.PP
swappy \- grab and edit on the fly snapshots of a Wayland compositor
.PP
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.PP
\fBswappy\fR [options.\&.\&.\&]
.PP
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
swappy is a command-line utility to take and edit screenshots of Wayland
desktops.\& Works great with grim, slurp and sway.\& But can easily work with
other screen copy tools that can output a final image to \fBstdout\fR.\&
.PP
swappy will save the annotated images to the config \fBsave_dir\fR, see below.\&
.PP
If absent, then if it will try to default to a \fBDesktop\fR folder following this
pattern: \fB$XDG_DESKTOP_DIR\fR.\& If this variable is not set, it will revert to:
\fB$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/Desktop\fR.\& If \fB$XDG_CONFIG_HOME\fR is not set, it will revert
to: \fB$HOME/Desktop\fR.\&
.PP
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
\fB-h, --help\fR
.RS 4
Show help message and quit.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-v, --version\fR
.RS 4
Show version and quit.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-f, --file\fR <file>
.RS 4
An image file to load for editing.\&
.PP
If set to \fB-\fR, read the file from standard input instead.\& This is grim
friendly.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-o, --output-file <file>\fR
.RS 4
Print the final surface to \fB<file>\fR when exiting the application.\&
.PP
If set to \fB-\fR, prints the final surface to \fBstdout\fR.\&
.PP
Note that the \fBSave\fR button will save the image to the config \fBsave_dir\fR
parameter, as described in the DESCRIPTION section.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH CONFIG FILE
.PP
The config file is located at \fB$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/swappy/config\fR or at
\fB$HOME/.\&config/swappy/config\fR.\& The file follows the GLib \fBconf\fR format.\&
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
	[Section]
	key=value
.fi
.RE
.PP
The following lines can be used as swappy'\&s default:
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
	[Default]
	save_dir=$HOME/Desktop
	save_filename_format=swappy-%Y%m%d-%H%M%S\&.png
	show_panel=false
	line_size=5
	text_size=20
	text_font=sans-serif
	paint_mode=brush
	early_exit=false
	fill_shape=false
	auto_save=false
	custom_color=rgba(192,125,17,1)
	transparent=false
	transparency=50
.fi
.RE
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBsave_dir\fR is where swappshots will be saved, can contain env variables, when it does not exist, swappy attempts to create it first, but does not abort if directory creation fails
.IP \(bu 4
\fBsave_filename_format\fR is the filename template, if it contains a date format, this will be parsed into a timestamp.\& Format is detailed in strftime(3).\& If this date format is missing, filename will have no timestamp
.IP \(bu 4
\fBshow_panel\fR is used to toggle the paint panel on or off upon startup
.IP \(bu 4
\fBline_size\fR is the default line size (must be between 1 and 50)
.IP \(bu 4
\fBtext_size\fR is the default text size (must be between 10 and 50)
.IP \(bu 4
\fBtext_font\fR is the font used to render text, its format is pango friendly
.IP \(bu 4
\fBpaint_mode\fR is the mode activated at application start (must be one of: brush|text|rectangle|ellipse|arrow|blur, matching is case-insensitive)
.IP \(bu 4
\fBearly_exit\fR is used to make the application exit after saving the picture or copying it to the clipboard
.IP \(bu 4
\fBfill_shape\fR is used to toggle shape filling (for the rectangle and ellipsis tools) on or off upon startup
.IP \(bu 4
\fBauto_save\fR is used to toggle auto saving of final buffer to \fBsave_dir\fR upon exit
.IP \(bu 4
\fBcustom_color\fR is used to set a default value for the custom color.\& Accepted
.PD
formats are: standard name (one of: https://github.\&com/rgb-x/system/blob/master/root/etc/X11/rgb.\&txt),  #rgb, #rrggbb, #rrrgggbbb, #rrrrggggbbbb, rgb(r,b,g), rgba(r,g,b,a)
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBtransparency\fR is used to set transparency of everything that is drawn during startup
.IP \(bu 4
\fBtransparent\fR is used to toggle transparency during startup
.PD
.PP
.PP
.SH KEY BINDINGS
.PP
.SS LAYOUT
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBCtrl+b\fR: Toggle Paint Panel
.PD
.PP
.SS PAINT MODE
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBb\fR: Switch to Brush
.IP \(bu 4
`e` `t`: Switch to Text (Editor)
.IP \(bu 4
`r` `s`: Switch to Rectangle (Square)
.IP \(bu 4
`c` `o`: Switch to Ellipse (Circle)
.IP \(bu 4
\fBa\fR: Switch to Arrow
.IP \(bu 4
\fBd\fR: Switch to Blur (d stands for droplet)
.PD
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBR\fR: Use Red Color
.IP \(bu 4
\fBG\fR: Use Green Color
.IP \(bu 4
\fBB\fR: Use Blue Color
.IP \(bu 4
\fBC\fR: Use Custom Color
.IP \(bu 4
\fBMinus\fR: Reduce Stroke Size
.IP \(bu 4
\fBPlus\fR: Increase Stroke Size
.IP \(bu 4
\fBEqual\fR: Reset Stroke Size
.IP \(bu 4
\fBf\fR: Toggle Shape Filling
.IP \(bu 4
\fBT\fR: Toggle Transparency
.IP \(bu 4
`x` `k`: Clear Paints (cannot be undone)
.PD
.PP
.SS MODIFIERS
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBCtrl\fR: Center Shape (Rectangle & Ellipse) based on draw start
.PD
.PP
.SS HEADER BAR
.PP
.PD 0
.IP \(bu 4
\fBCtrl+z\fR: Undo
.IP \(bu 4
\fBCtrl+Shift+z\fR or \fBCtrl+y\fR: Redo
.IP \(bu 4
\fBCtrl+s\fR: Save to file (see man page)
.IP \(bu 4
\fBCtrl+c\fR: Copy to clipboard
.IP \(bu 4
\fBEscape\fR or \fBq\fR or \fBCtrl+w\fR: Quit swappy
.PD
.PP
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.PP
